1
00:00:09,165 --> 00:00:12,357
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,664 --> 00:00:15,811
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,098 --> 00:00:18,624
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,671 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,049
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,263 --> 00:00:29,476
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:32,222
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,269 --> 00:00:36,089
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,249 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,656 --> 00:00:42,809
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,115 --> 00:00:45,555
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:49,096
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,146 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 1=

15
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,920
Elder Murong,

16
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,760
you've told us the names

17
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:12,599
of the ten ancient mythical beasts.

18
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:14,519
But if we were to rank them by strength,

19
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,519
(Wang Jie, Heavenly Sword Sect Disciple)
which one is the most powerful?

20
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:18,599
(Elder Murong, Heavenly Sword Sect)
The strongest and most troublesome

21
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,239
of them all has to be Bai Xi.

22
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:22,040
Bai Xi?

23
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:25,719
The legendary Bai Xi
who shares Goddess Nuwa's origin?

24
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:26,400
Yes.

25
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:28,120
She shares the same origin
as Goddess Nuwa,

26
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,200
with boundless demonic power.

27
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:31,120
Her cultivation is naturally formidable,

28
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:33,599
but she's brutal and quick-tempered.

29
00:01:33,719 --> 00:01:34,680
She likes to eat humans.

30
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:36,280
The trickier part is that

31
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,719
most of the time

32
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:39,239
she disguises herself as a human.

33
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,799
She's nearly impossible to track.

34
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,439
No wonder the three Sword Immortals

35
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,519
had to join forces to slay her.

36
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:46,200
Too bad she managed to escape unscathed.

37
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,799
Then how can we tell

38
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,439
if Bai Xi has taken human form?

39
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:50,920
Her true form is over ten thousand feet long.

40
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,840
And she prefers to appear
as a beautiful woman.

41
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:54,239
Every time she transforms,

42
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:56,319
Bai Xi sheds her skin.

43
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,560
So there will be

44
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,519
lots of skin or scales left nearby.

45
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,640
(Zhao Feiyang, Heavenly Sword Sect)
Beautiful women,

46
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,640
troublesome...

47
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,040
Is there any way to counter her?

48
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:29,520
You're just a servant.

49
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:32,039
What right do you have to speak
at the sect assembly?

50
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,639
Learn some manners!

51
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:34,960
Exactly.

52
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:37,479
My... my apologies.

53
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,000
As for how to counter her,

54
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,080
Bai Xi has a serpent bloodline,

55
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:44,560
so realgar and strong liquor

56
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:45,919
have some effect on her.

57
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,240
Also:

58
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,039
Bai Xi enjoys drinking unrooted water,

59
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,520
namely rainwater

60
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:52,919
or dew.

61
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,840
Recent rumors say

62
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,560
she may very well be hiding
right here in Dongzhou.

63
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,560
So be careful

64
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:00,919
when you're out,

65
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,520
especially the male disciples.

66
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,719
Bai Xi likes to eat young men
rich in yang energy.

67
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,120
If some unknown beauty

68
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,240
throws herself at you,

69
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,919
be especially careful.

70
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:14,240
Thank you for your guidance,
Elder Murong!

71
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:15,960
Dismissed.

72
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,680
Can you believe it?

73
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,560
Three years ago,

74
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,879
he was our sect's chief disciple.

75
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,879
But his family was massacred,

76
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,520
and his fiancée took
his high-grade Dao Bone.

77
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,560
Now he's like a stray dog.

78
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,319
(The strongest and most troublesome)

79
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:02,960
(of them all has to be Bai Xi.)

80
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,039
(She prefers to appear
as a beautiful woman.)

81
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:17,560
(If some unknown beauty
throws herself at you,)

82
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,040
(be especially careful.)

83
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:20,240
Dear!

84
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,160
You're back.

85
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:32,720
Oh,

86
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,040
stop calling me that.

87
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,439
We're not officially married yet.

88
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:36,959
I insist.

89
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,040
You saved my life.

90
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,120
I have no way to repay you,

91
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:40,480
so I can only offer myself to you.

92
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,600
Or do you

93
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:44,360
find me repulsive

94
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,040
and want to abandon me?

95
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:46,920
No.

96
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,000
Of course not!

97
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,879
How could I ever abandon you?

98
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,000
That's good.

99
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,439
Dear, just wait.

100
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,680
I'll make you something delicious!

101
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:04,839
(Bai Xi enjoys drinking unrooted water,)

102
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,160
(namely rainwater)

103
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,759
(or dew.)

104
00:05:14,959 --> 00:05:15,399
Bai!

105
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:16,720
Isn't...

106
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:17,959
Isn't that rainwater from last night?

107
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:18,879
You're drinking it just like that?

108
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,279
I love rainwater.

109
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,040
It comes from above. It's clean.

110
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,600
Dear,

111
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:28,879
I'm going to clean the room.

112
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:35,079
(Could she really be...)

113
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,720
(No way.)

114
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,839
(It can't be such a coincidence.)

115
00:05:52,959 --> 00:05:53,800
(She's injured so badly.)

116
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,759
(Every time she transforms,)

117
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:06,000
(Bai Xi sheds her skin.)

118
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,279
(So there will be)

119
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:10,160
(lots of skin or scales left nearby.)

120
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,639
No wonder...

121
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:18,199
With my Dao Bone gone,

122
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,360
why would a woman like her

123
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,439
stay by my side?

124
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,120
(Bai Xi likes to eat young men
rich in yang energy.)

125
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:30,040
Is she going to eat me?

126
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:33,079
Why hasn't she made a move?

127
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,079
Blessing or curse,

128
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,000
I should ask her and find out.

129
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,480
Dear, what brings you here?

130
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:56,680
What's this?

131
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,720
Scales.

132
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,519
Where did they come from?

133
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,519
Dear,

134
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,000
you brought them here yourself,

135
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:05,839
and you're asking me?

136
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,199
(If I confront her now)

137
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,439
(and she attacks,)

138
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,319
(I won't make it out alive.)

139
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,360
(But I still have a blood feud
to settle.)

140
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,959
(I can't accept)

141
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,680
(dying like this.)

142
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,680
Dear,

143
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:21,120
what's wrong?

144
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,600
Are you feeling unwell?

145
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:24,920
No.

146
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,560
I'm not done sweeping yet.

147
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,800
Step out for a while.

148
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:44,839
Chen Qiushui?

149
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,560
What are you doing here?

150
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:48,072
(Chen Qiushui, Tianxuan Holy Maiden)
I'm going to the Heavenly Sword Sect

151
00:07:48,072 --> 00:07:48,819
(Qingzhu, Holy Maiden's Maid)

152
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:50,000
tomorrow, so I thought I'd stop by.

153
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:51,199
You're not welcome here.

154
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,160
Get lost!

155
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,120
How dare you

156
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,720
show such disrespect to our Holy Maiden?

157
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,240
Zhao Feiyang!

158
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,560
I'm here to tell you:

159
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,879
I'm determined to claim
a divine-grade Dao Bone

160
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,959
from the Heavenly Sword Sect.

161
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:07,800
Then,

162
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:10,040
I'll return your high-grade Dao Bone

163
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,879
and give you some pills

164
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,639
to help you return to your peak.

165
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:18,319
Return it to me?

166
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,720
And give me pills?

167
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,120
What is this supposed to be?

168
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,120
Compensation?

169
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,120
You can see it that way.

170
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,439
Even if you win
that divine-grade Dao Bone,

171
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:29,839
my Dao Bone

172
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,160
is just worthless scrap

173
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:32,600
you've used and discarded.

174
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,080
Now you're giving me back

175
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,679
what you no longer want

176
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,360
and expect me to thank you?

177
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:38,919
Chen Qiushui,

178
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,200
you've really got this all figured out,
don't you?

179
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,279
You...

180
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,679
Zhao Feiyang,

181
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,720
I know I wronged you,

182
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:49,600
but I've never forgotten what we had.

183
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,799
Once I obtain the divine-grade Dao Bone,

184
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:53,919
besides returning your Dao Bone,

185
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:56,679
I'll also grant you a great opportunity.

186
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,799
Even more,

187
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,120
if you still wish to honor
our betrothal,

188
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,080
I won't refuse.

189
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,519
Our betrothal?

190
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,360
You still want to go through with it?

191
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:07,320
Yes.

192
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:09,720
There's so much

193
00:09:10,159 --> 00:09:11,759
weighing on us.

194
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:12,879
Even so,

195
00:09:13,759 --> 00:09:15,440
you'll always have a place

196
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,039
in my heart.

197
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:21,000
Dear?

198
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,080
Who is she?

199
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,080
Who are you?

200
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,879
Why are you touching my husband?

201
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:32,840
Zhao Feiyang,

202
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,120
you're married?

203
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,279
She's just...

204
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:44,879
Yes,

205
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:45,960
he's married.

206
00:09:46,519 --> 00:09:47,720
Stop bothering him,

207
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:48,720
or else

208
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,840
I'll make you regret it!

209
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,480
Make us regret it?

210
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,519
What a bold claim!

211
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:56,399
A mere village woman
with no spiritual energy

212
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,919
dares to talk big

213
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,039
in front of our Holy Maiden?

214
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,759
You've got a death wish!

215
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:02,720
Zhao Feiyang,

216
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,440
tell me this isn't true!

217
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:09,279
It is.

218
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,840
She is my wife.

219
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,879
We've got nothing to talk about anymore.

220
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,440
And I will never forgive
what you've done.

221
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:22,440
Leave our home at once!

222
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:25,879
Very well.

223
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,440
Zhao Feiyang,

224
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,000
you'll regret this.

225
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:39,840
I'm sorry.

226
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,600
I was just...

227
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:42,840
It's okay, dear.

228
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,080
I'll go make dinner.

229
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,559
What's wrong, dear?

230
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,480
Who are you, really?

231
00:10:56,006 --> 00:10:59,635
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

232
00:10:59,918 --> 00:11:02,591
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

233
00:11:02,851 --> 00:11:06,398
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

234
00:11:06,578 --> 00:11:10,784
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

235
00:11:11,231 --> 00:11:14,484
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

236
00:11:14,851 --> 00:11:17,657
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

237
00:11:17,971 --> 00:11:21,351
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

238
00:11:21,484 --> 00:11:25,712
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

239
00:11:26,146 --> 00:11:29,279
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

240
00:11:29,572 --> 00:11:32,646
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

241
00:11:33,219 --> 00:11:36,059
♪With this flesh and soul♪

242
00:11:36,292 --> 00:11:39,306
♪I shall forge a new age♪

243
00:11:39,752 --> 00:11:42,820
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

244
00:11:43,072 --> 00:11:46,160
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

245
00:11:46,379 --> 00:11:48,612
♪At cultivation's peak♪

246
00:11:48,752 --> 00:11:52,592
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

247
00:11:52,997 --> 00:11:55,617
♪The sun and moon turn♪

248
00:11:55,644 --> 00:11:59,310
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

249
00:11:59,770 --> 00:12:06,551
♪I am the undying flame♪

250
00:12:07,225 --> 00:12:11,945
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

251
00:12:12,299 --> 00:12:15,479
♪At last I see, immortality♪

252
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:20,280
♪Lives in your smiles.♪
